Joe: Short,

00:24:11.316 --> 00:24:13.218
Nikhil: a tall,
Joe: tall,

00:24:13.218 --> 00:24:15.053
Nikhil: a grande,
Joe: grande,

00:24:15.053 --> 00:24:16.855
