00:32:43.461 --> 00:32:47.098
Chai tea, or as we call
it here in India, chai.

00:32:47.098 --> 00:32:48.933
Can I just say, it's a bit of a pet peeve

00:32:48.933 --> 00:32:51.336
when you guys call chai "chai tea."

00:32:51.336 --> 00:32:53.905
It's like calling tea "tea tea."

00:32:53.905 --> 00:32:55.707
Let me describe a good chai to you.

00:32:55.707 --> 00:32:58.343
All right, it should be
warm. It should be gingery.

00:32:58.343 --> 00:33:01.713
It should feel like a hug from
your mum in your childhood,

00:33:01.713 --> 00:33:03.181
and it should perk your morning up.

00:33:03.181 --> 00:33:05.550
And it should be under 10
rupees, but this is expensive.

00:33:12.924 --> 00:33:15.693
Hello! It's Crystelle, and
I'm here to talk about chai,

00:33:15.693 --> 00:33:17.495
which is actually my favorite drink.

00:33:17.495 --> 00:33:19.864
Every person has their
own recipe for chai,

00:33:19.864 --> 00:33:21.699
but it's a combination
of spices and black tea

00:33:21.699 --> 00:33:23.868
and some milk, and usually
sweetened with a bit of sugar.

00:33:23.868 --> 00:33:25.770
But for me at home, in my recipe,

00:33:25.770 --> 00:33:28.306
cardamom is the most important spice,

00:33:28.306 --> 00:33:31.142
cinnamon, ginger, a pinch of cloves,

00:33:31.142 --> 00:33:33.678
and my secret spice is
a bit of black pepper,

00:33:33.678 --> 00:33:36.147
just to give that lovely,
warming, spicy feeling,

00:33:36.147 --> 00:33:37.181
but it's not savory.

00:33:37.181 --> 00:33:39.317
It's just a lovely blend of spices.

00:33:42.153 --> 00:33:45.623
The flavor is not bad,
but I wouldn't call this,

00:33:45.623 --> 00:33:46.657
I wouldn't call this a chai.

00:33:46.657 --> 00:33:48.693
You know what? This is a chai tea!

00:33:48.693 --> 00:33:50.161
Because it's not quite a chai,

00:33:50.161 --> 00:33:51.796
it's not quite a tea.

00:33:51.796 --> 00:33:54.232
Fair enough, Starbucks. It's a chai tea.

00:33:54.232 --> 00:33:56.234
Next up, and the drink
I'm most excited to have,

00:33:56.234 --> 00:33:57.435
